[1] Fraknoi, Andrew, David Morrison, and Sidney Wolff. The Sky Above. In Astronomy 2e. Houston, Texas : OpenStax, 2022. \PMlinkexternal{The Sky Above}{https://openstax.org/books/astronomy-2e/pages/2-1-the-sky-above} \\ 

